Z||000018||88 Fiero||09-22-1999||03:17 PM||||MW....glad you like it...the Distributor Cap..I got it at AutoZone for $16.00 with the rotor's included...Yes...the it has brass contacts...I took out the EGR tube and block it on both sides...It did not affect anything..also the EGR solenoid is also disconected and wires are re-wired to fool the computer thinking it's still there. One of the fiero buddies that I know indicated that it is not needed specially if the car is modified...he thinks there's no need to route the exhaust to the engine and the EGR.. My EGR Valve is only for show, just to make it look like it's functioning...but actually it's non-functional...||||reg||2
